Serve this directory as plain static files.

Without this, GitHub Pages runs Jekyll over it: every `.md` in `docs/` and
`docs/decisions/` would be rendered as a page, anything beginning with `_`
would be dropped silently, and Liquid would try to interpret `{{` and `{%`
wherever they appear in the prose. None of that is wanted here - the only
document this site exists to serve is `how-inwire-works.html`, which is a
single self-contained file with its own CSS and twelve inline SVGs.
